WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.521
Find a completed trade.

2
00:00:01.641 --> 00:00:04.044
Open Practice Lab and choose Journal.

3
00:00:04.164 --> 00:00:06.869
Select the completed virtual trade you want to review.

4
00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:26.781
Write the reflection.

5
00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:31.383
Enter why you took the trade, what could invalidate the idea, and what you learned.

6
00:00:31.503 --> 00:00:34.405
Choose the emotion that best describes the decision.

7
00:00:35.425 --> 00:00:36.261
Save the note.

8
00:00:36.381 --> 00:00:39.271
Save the journal entry and review the saved feedback.

9
00:00:39.391 --> 00:00:43.118
Keep notes specific enough to improve your next practice decision.

